OL,3,AEgyptian journalist's retrial adjourned
OL,4,Aas UN warns of 'assaults on press
OL,5,Afreedom'
OL,6,
OL,7,FA criminal court in Cairo has postponed
OL,8,Fthe retrial of the prominent Egyptian
OL,9,Fjournalist Lina Attalah, whose case has
OL,10,Fdrawn international condemnation.
OL,12,FWednesday's opening hearing was
OL,13,Fadjourned until 18 November after
OL,14,Fdefence lawyers representing the
OL,15,Feditor-in-chief of the news outlet Mada
OL,16,FMasr requested a new judge.
OL,18,FThe UN has warned of "widening assaults
OL,19,Fon press freedom by Egyptian
OL,20,Fauthorities, including the targeting,
OL,21,Fpersecution and harassment of
OL,22,Findependent journalists".
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
