OL,3,AEgyptian journalist's retrial adjourned
OL,4,Aas UN warns of 'assaults on press
OL,5,Afreedom'
OL,6,
OL,7,FAttalah told the BBC that a recent
OL,8,Fcrackdown was meant to "send a chilling
OL,9,Fmessage" to "the very few newsrooms
OL,10,Fthat are left".
